{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261121/photo/bkn-20261121190028940-1121_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261121195948\"/><p>震央位於德令哈市附近，圖為當地火車站。</p><p>青海省海西州周五（20日）傍晚6時45分發生黎克特制5.6級地震，震央位於德令哈市附近，震源深度10公里。青海消防救援總隊前突小隊正在震央附近排查，暫未發現房屋倒塌和人員傷亡。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T12:44:01.588339+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T11:00:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T12:37:17.236640+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T12:37:17.236640+00:00","content_hash":"0555e81015fc07e60f7849f432839f1cb81ea3886225b7b590ec89fbc3b2c3ea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}